	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg11306"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=174" title="View the profile of Delheru">Delheru</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Guild Leader<br />
								Splitpaw Gnoll<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 97<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/blank.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=174"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=991.msg11306#msg11306"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=991.msg11306#msg11306">Re: Rodcet Nife Allstars</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #122 on:</b> September 20, 2004, 09:44:08 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=991.msg11282#msg11282">Quote from: Dwalion SoulVoid on September 19, 2004, 05:17:48 pm</a></div><div class="quote"><div class="quoteheader"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=991.msg11076#msg11076">Quote from: Delheru on September 12, 2004, 08:00:28 am</a></div><div class="quote">I should have booted his sorry ass a long time ago though, but he apped when we still needed power to beat down AoD/AL, and couldn&#039;t be all that picky. <br /></div>Although this quote is about Lower, it applies to those of you who applied since.<br /><br />couldn&#039;t be all that picky.....Delheru, your an ass ^^.</div><br />At least I&#039;m honest.<br />If some guild here says they&#039;re extremely picky, I&#039;m going to have to assume they&#039;re either full of shit, or wouldn&#039;t recognize skill and intelligence if they bit them on the nose.<br /><br />Most of the people that got in Ascent were pretty good. Frankly the huge wave we had (we started 107 apps at once) during PoP turned out to be really good, which I found really surprising, considering how little attention we could pay to them at the time (then again we dropped everyone that made a single mistake that wave, which pretty efficiently weeded out the hopeless).<br /><br />Anyway people in Ascent knew what I thought of them I&#039;m sure. Frankly there weren&#039;t many cases where people ended up in the red, even though some good players had some awful annoying traits (Kered and dkphogging being a very good example). Those that ended up in the red never got much love from the rest of the guild either, so I guess I just say what others think. It&#039;s rather more efficient frankly, and not as lame and cowardly.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg11338"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=813" title="View the profile of Justyse">Justyse</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Guild Officer<br />
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 5<br />
								<br />
