							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Biased to the people I grouped with, raided with, or knew from community posts and channels.<br /><br />Bard - Baelt, Mance (that&#039;s right bitches, me...), Diol, Chorum<br />Beastlord - Beguera<br />Cleric - Sinef, Ysabeau, Rrinnae<br />Druid - Mutsumi, Stevensmalls<br />Enchanter - Vosh<br />Mage - Tiiden<br />Monk - Arhra, Lizzoraus<br />Necro - Sinndawn<br />Paladin - Calsedon<br />Ranger - Phytons, Shaewyn<br />Rogue - Justyse, Robb<br />Shaman - Articstorm, Dissonant<br />Shadowknight - Jeddah, Grem, Syare<br />Warrior - Wyeld, Zubbzubb<br />Wizard - um...  none stand out
